Package: LLMCellType
Type: Package
Title: Provider-agnostic automated cell type annotation with large language models in single-cell RNA-seq analysis - A fork of GPTCellType.
Version: 0.0.3
Author: Wenpin Hou, Zhicheng Ji, pwwang
Maintainer: pwwang <pwwang@pwwang.com>
Description: Provider-agnostic automated cell type annotation with large
        language models (OpenAI, Anthropic, Google Gemini, or a local Ollama
        server, via the ellmer package) in single-cell RNA-seq analysis.
        Reference-free and cost-effective: no reference atlas is needed and
        only the top marker genes per cluster are sent to the model.
Encoding: UTF-8
License: MIT + file LICENSE
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Imports: ellmer
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, markdown, Seurat
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
NeedsCompilation: no
